WEBVTT

00:01.126 --> 00:06.089
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

00:06.089 --> 00:10.886
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

00:10.886 --> 00:20.687
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

00:20.687 --> 00:25.442
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

00:25.442 --> 00:29.321
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

00:30.697 --> 00:34.618
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

00:34.618 --> 00:37.829
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

00:39.248 --> 00:44.002
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

00:44.002 --> 00:48.674
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

00:48.674 --> 00:50.926
♪See the world through my eyes♪

00:50.926 --> 00:53.262
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

00:53.262 --> 00:58.767
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

00:59.977 --> 01:04.356
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:04.815 --> 01:09.361
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

01:09.361 --> 01:14.366
♪Because you have given it to me♪

01:14.366 --> 01:21.164
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

01:40.976 --> 01:42.352
Hey, kid.

01:42.978 --> 01:46.732
That's the tea my daughter
brewed just for you.

01:46.732 --> 01:50.694
You'd better drink it with all the
gratitude you have for this world.

01:50.694 --> 01:52.654
T-Tea?

01:52.654 --> 01:53.614
Um...

01:55.073 --> 01:56.825
Well...

01:56.825 --> 01:58.368
Please have a sip!

01:58.368 --> 02:00.662
Huh? Um...

02:00.662 --> 02:02.122
Who are you two...

02:02.122 --> 02:03.790
Oh, just drink already, will you!

02:03.790 --> 02:07.836
What, you can't drink the
tea my daughter made for you?!

02:07.836 --> 02:10.255
- Drink the heck up!
- It's hot, so take it slow.

02:13.258 --> 02:14.718
Tasty...

02:16.011 --> 02:19.014
That's... good to hear.

02:19.514 --> 02:21.016
She's so cute...

02:21.016 --> 02:25.646
Hey, pull any funny stunt on her,
and I will delete your existence.

02:29.358 --> 02:32.527
So, you two saved me?

02:32.527 --> 02:37.616
I never wanted to save
inferior beings like you.

02:37.616 --> 02:42.245
But Yuri begged me on her knees
to save you.

02:42.245 --> 02:45.624
I had no choice but to wipe out
those monsters for you.

02:45.624 --> 02:49.628
Offer your deep gratitude to Yuri
with every fiber of your being.

02:50.253 --> 02:52.464
I didn't do anything.

02:52.464 --> 02:55.550
I won't help him, hadn't you asked me.

02:55.550 --> 02:58.261
Hey, kid! Kneel down to Yuri!

02:58.261 --> 03:01.640
Offer gratitude deeper than the sea
and taller than the mountains!

03:01.640 --> 03:05.519
Um... Thank you very much, Yuri.

03:06.866 --> 03:08.939
Don't mention it.

03:10.607 --> 03:12.984
Don't call my daughter casually!

03:12.984 --> 03:15.237
That's offensive! I will delete you!

03:15.237 --> 03:19.700
Mother! I'm happy when
someone calls my name.

03:19.700 --> 03:20.617
Huh?

03:20.617 --> 03:23.078
Daughter? Mother?

03:23.078 --> 03:25.122
Wait, are you her mother?

03:25.122 --> 03:27.708
Mother, huh?

03:27.708 --> 03:29.376
I guess I do look the part.

03:29.376 --> 03:31.920
My name is Ursula.

03:31.920 --> 03:33.755
The guardian of Yggdrasil.

03:35.173 --> 03:36.550
A guardian?

03:37.134 --> 03:40.095
There are nine Yggdrasils in this world.

03:40.095 --> 03:44.766
Each of them relies on a guardian
to observe and protect them.

03:44.766 --> 03:47.519
We protect them from outside threats.

03:47.519 --> 03:49.604
That is what we, guardians, are.

03:50.230 --> 03:50.897
So...

03:50.897 --> 03:53.108
Do you live here?

03:53.108 --> 03:54.401
Yeah.

03:54.401 --> 03:58.905
I have been living at the root of this land
ever since this child took root here.

03:58.905 --> 04:00.907
Took root?

04:00.907 --> 04:02.534
Isn't Yuri a human?

04:02.534 --> 04:03.410
No.

04:03.410 --> 04:06.329
Yuri is the Yggdrasil itself.

04:06.329 --> 04:09.124
Its will, to be precise.

04:09.124 --> 04:14.546
To put it simply, for your tiny brain,
she's the spirit of the Yggdrasil.

04:18.049 --> 04:20.218
No wonder she's so gorgeous.

04:22.554 --> 04:25.056
Don't you dare flirt with my child!

04:25.056 --> 04:28.518
You will taint the eye
I worked so hard on!

04:28.518 --> 04:30.562
Eye? That reminds me!

04:31.271 --> 04:34.149
A Death Bear gouged my eye out.

04:34.691 --> 04:36.401
I got severely injured, too...

04:40.530 --> 04:42.032
Yet I'm recovered?

04:42.032 --> 04:45.327
The Yggdrasil droplets
healed your injuries.

04:45.327 --> 04:48.622
However, I couldn't
regenerate your crushed eye.

04:48.622 --> 04:53.543
With great reverence, I used a part of
the Yggdrasil to craft a new eye.

04:53.543 --> 04:56.546
A spirit's prosthetic eye.

04:56.546 --> 04:59.424
A spirit's prosthetic eye?

04:59.925 --> 05:02.135
It's only because Yuri asked me to.

05:02.135 --> 05:06.223
She wanted to grant you strength
and make it so you can see again.

05:07.140 --> 05:09.935
Otherwise, why would I care
about a human kid like you?

05:10.460 --> 05:12.812
Why would you go that far?

05:12.813 --> 05:14.564
Well, it's because...

05:15.398 --> 05:16.817
You were so kind...

05:17.359 --> 05:19.903
It was you who saved my life.

05:20.223 --> 05:21.488
Thank you.

05:23.907 --> 05:27.369
...as to thank me.

05:29.120 --> 05:32.040
It's rare for a person
to fall into this abyss,

05:32.040 --> 05:34.876
but Yuri saved every single one that did.

05:35.502 --> 05:39.756
Yet none of them thanked her for it.

05:39.756 --> 05:43.301
On the contrary, once they found out
that Yuri is the Yggdrasil,

05:43.301 --> 05:47.264
they became so audacious as to casually
tear off branches and leaves.

05:47.789 --> 05:52.310
That's why your words
really made her happy.

05:53.895 --> 05:57.107
Thank you for saving me twice.

05:57.107 --> 05:59.276
Yuri, you are my savior.

06:03.196 --> 06:04.531
Anyway...

06:04.531 --> 06:08.827
Now that your life has been saved,
hurry up and get out of here, kid.

06:08.827 --> 06:09.411
What?

06:09.411 --> 06:11.288
Wait, Mother!

06:11.288 --> 06:14.499
It's dangerous out there.
Ein is risking his life.

06:14.499 --> 06:18.670
That has nothing to do with us.
I don't care whatever happens to him.

06:18.670 --> 06:20.213
Well, you should!

06:20.213 --> 06:22.716
Please, can't you do something?

06:22.716 --> 06:24.801
Even if you say that...

06:24.801 --> 06:29.222
As a guardian, I can't stray
too far from you, the Yggdrasil.

06:29.222 --> 06:32.309
So it's impossible for me
to escort him outside.

06:32.309 --> 06:36.313
Teleportation magic can't be used
inside this dungeon either.

06:38.023 --> 06:39.608
No way...

06:39.608 --> 06:42.569
Oh, Yuri, my dear!
Please don't be so sad!

06:42.569 --> 06:45.822
If you are sad, I am sad too!

06:48.325 --> 06:53.204
Oh, my. You care about him
that much, don't you...

07:04.007 --> 07:06.760
Okay, fine.

07:06.760 --> 07:08.345
Then, let's do this.

07:08.710 --> 07:11.806
Listen here, kid!
I will train you!

07:11.808 --> 07:12.349
What?

07:12.849 --> 07:15.352
I'll make you strong enough
to get out on your own.

07:15.755 --> 07:17.393
How does that sound?

07:17.395 --> 07:20.190
Thank you so much, Mother!

07:20.190 --> 07:23.234
Well, it's your request, after all.

07:25.149 --> 07:26.150
I...

07:26.780 --> 07:28.990
I will be able to get out of here...

07:29.824 --> 07:31.117
...alive?

07:31.993 --> 07:34.287
Thank you very much!

07:34.287 --> 07:36.498
Get off me, you annoying kid!

07:36.500 --> 07:40.377
You'll be strictly tutored
by the strongest sage there is!

07:40.377 --> 07:43.463
I won't have you take
my challenges lightly!

07:48.293 --> 07:49.878
Thank you, ma'am!

07:53.640 --> 07:55.725
Uh, so...

07:55.725 --> 08:00.313
S-Surely you won't get me to start
with an actual combat. Right?

08:00.313 --> 08:06.152
If you keep studying so slowly,
you'll leave as a frail old man.

08:06.152 --> 08:08.154
Let's get you strong quicker.

08:08.863 --> 08:09.990
Try looking that way.

08:12.742 --> 08:15.704
Uh, I see nothing, though.

08:15.704 --> 08:17.205
You fool!

08:17.205 --> 08:22.669
That left eye of yours has, with great reverence,
a part of the Yggdrasil embedded in it!

08:22.919 --> 08:25.846
It doesn't seem any different from before.

08:25.848 --> 08:28.675
That's because you have no self-awareness.

08:29.117 --> 08:30.844
Self-awareness, huh?

08:31.469 --> 08:34.431
My original left eye was
crushed by Death Bear.

08:35.265 --> 08:38.393
In an instant, I found myself
in complete darkness.

08:39.936 --> 08:41.187
But, then...

08:42.230 --> 08:45.233
Yuri gave me light.

08:45.859 --> 08:49.654
The scenery I see and the world that
I'll witness from now on,

08:49.654 --> 08:52.015
is by the light Yuri gave me.

08:53.491 --> 08:55.660
Huh? What is this?

08:56.202 --> 08:57.829
My eyes feel warm...

09:00.331 --> 09:03.460
Huh? What's this?

09:03.460 --> 09:06.129
Now we can finally begin the training.

09:09.257 --> 09:11.426
Wait! Why would you do that?

09:11.426 --> 09:12.761
Here it comes.

09:15.597 --> 09:18.975
Now, you'll dodge all of its movements.

09:18.975 --> 09:20.602
That's your first step.

09:20.602 --> 09:22.854
Huh? Is that even possible?

09:22.854 --> 09:25.940
Isn't Appraisal your specialty?

09:25.940 --> 09:29.986
Well, it is, but it only gives me insights
about items or monsters...

09:29.986 --> 09:34.240
The Spirit Eye's Appraisal is different
from that of a human's eye.

09:34.783 --> 09:35.992
Just try it.

09:35.992 --> 09:39.204
You're basically telling me to
appraise its movement...

09:40.538 --> 09:42.207
A-Appraise!

09:42.950 --> 09:44.918
(Gremlin's Movement (S) – Flies at high speed
to the right ear and slashes it with its sickle.)

09:44.918 --> 09:46.044
I got the reading!

09:46.044 --> 09:47.545
Nice!

09:48.922 --> 09:54.677
The Spirit Eye can appraise things in ways
that human eyes can't even compare to.

09:54.677 --> 09:56.930
That means opponent's movements as well.

09:56.930 --> 10:00.183
Indeed it can appraise
that as well, like you said...

10:01.935 --> 10:02.977
Ugh...

10:04.437 --> 10:05.939
Good grief...

10:10.860 --> 10:11.945
Huh?

10:11.945 --> 10:14.531
It doesn't hurt anymore,
and it's healed. How...

10:14.531 --> 10:18.326
It's the Yggdrasil droplets.
Yuri gave us some.

10:18.326 --> 10:20.245
Huh? Wouldn't that mean...

10:20.245 --> 10:22.080
Rest assured.

10:22.080 --> 10:26.183
No matter how tattered a rag
you'll be, I'll heal you to the brim.

10:26.185 --> 10:27.500
Which means you'll work to death
to master your skills, literally.

10:27.500 --> 10:29.870
(Inevitable death)
Which means you'll work to death
to master your skills, literally.

10:29.870 --> 10:30.380
Which means you'll work to death
to master your skills, literally.

10:31.256 --> 10:32.924
Isn't that a bit too cruel?

10:32.924 --> 10:35.969
Come on now, no time for dilly-dallying.

10:37.512 --> 10:38.513
Appraise!

10:38.720 --> 10:39.639
(Gremlin's Movement (S)
Sickle attack to the left leg.)

10:39.639 --> 10:41.307
(Gremlin's Movement (S))
I know what it's aiming for, but...

10:41.307 --> 10:44.435
(Sickle attack to the left leg.)
With my current reflexes, I can't react!

10:44.435 --> 10:47.397
If only I could figure out the timing...

10:47.397 --> 10:51.401
No, it's the Spirit Eye.
Don't think in human terms!

10:52.527 --> 10:54.279
Reappraise!

10:55.440 --> 10:57.780
(Gremlin's Movement (S)
Left leg attack in five seconds.)

10:58.408 --> 11:01.286
It really works as I thought!
Now, then...

11:01.286 --> 11:05.707
Five, four, three, two, one.

11:06.166 --> 11:06.916
Zero!

11:08.668 --> 11:09.419
I did it!

11:09.419 --> 11:13.256
I dodged the attack of an S-Rank
monster for the first time!

11:13.256 --> 11:15.617
Did you see that, Ursu—

11:16.743 --> 11:20.889
Good grief. You're getting ahead of yourself
just because you dodged it once.

11:21.890 --> 11:25.143
She's right.
I shouldn't be getting ahead of myself.

11:25.143 --> 11:28.229
Where is it aiming, when is it attacking,

11:28.229 --> 11:31.774
I need to appraise
both of them as I breathe.

11:32.275 --> 11:34.277
Once I nail that down,

11:35.945 --> 11:38.072
my world will change!

11:45.371 --> 11:48.499
It's been a week
since he started training.

11:48.763 --> 11:50.001
Appraise!

11:50.660 --> 11:53.120
(Gremlin's Movement (S)
Sickle attack to the left eye in two seconds.)

11:55.420 --> 11:58.550
(Sickle attack to the right eye
in three seconds.)

11:59.886 --> 12:01.387
How is it, Ursula?

12:01.638 --> 12:03.973
I can dodge it perfectly—

12:04.641 --> 12:07.393
That hurts!

12:07.393 --> 12:11.356
One learns a lot faster through pain,
as I expected.

12:11.356 --> 12:13.358
I bet you're enjoying this...

12:13.358 --> 12:16.277
I suppose I'm pleased that you've
reached a passing grade.

12:17.111 --> 12:19.972
Well then, let's move on
to the next training.

12:21.532 --> 12:24.535
Show me that you can defeat a gremlin.

12:24.535 --> 12:27.580
My job is not combat-oriented.

12:27.582 --> 12:28.790
I wouldn't be able to...

12:28.790 --> 12:31.376
I don't need you
to tell me that, you fool.

12:31.376 --> 12:34.504
Don't rely on your skills, use that eye
and make do with it.

12:34.504 --> 12:36.130
That's the training.

12:36.130 --> 12:37.173
Using my eye?

12:37.173 --> 12:38.054
Here.

12:38.424 --> 12:40.760
A wooden sword made from
Yggdrasil's branch.

12:41.386 --> 12:42.679
That Yuri...

12:43.526 --> 12:49.100
Mother, can you give this to Ein?

12:49.102 --> 12:52.355
Because I want to be of help, too.

12:53.929 --> 12:55.321
Did she?

12:55.323 --> 13:00.571
My precious Yuri crafted this with a branch
she snapped while enduring the pain!

13:00.571 --> 13:03.783
If you break it, I'll break you!

13:03.783 --> 13:06.703
I get it! I'll handle it with care!

13:08.121 --> 13:10.707
Thank you, Yuri.

13:15.460 --> 13:15.920
(Gremlin's Movement (S)
Sickle attack to the right leg in three seconds.)

13:15.920 --> 13:18.923
Now that I know when
and where it will attack me,

13:19.590 --> 13:23.428
I can just face it head-on! Easy.

13:23.428 --> 13:26.431
Three, two, one...

13:26.431 --> 13:27.348
Now!

13:29.559 --> 13:30.310
Huh?

13:30.310 --> 13:31.311
Why?

13:31.311 --> 13:34.397
Forget about landing any attacks
if you are that slow.

13:34.397 --> 13:35.732
What do I do, then?

13:35.732 --> 13:37.025
Go figure it out yourself.

13:37.025 --> 13:38.318
Of course...

13:38.901 --> 13:40.528
No, wait.

13:40.528 --> 13:43.990
What if I just point this wooden sword
to where it's aiming for...

13:44.570 --> 13:46.159
(Gremlin's Movement (S)
Sickle attack to the right eye in two seconds)
That way...

13:46.159 --> 13:48.661
In two, one, zero!

13:50.538 --> 13:51.539
That didn't work?

13:51.539 --> 13:55.418
I guess that's a given.
It also has a brain to think, too.

13:55.418 --> 13:58.171
It will likely dodge a weapon
before itself.

13:58.171 --> 14:00.214
Darn. I shouldn't keep this mindset.

14:00.214 --> 14:02.925
Humans and spirits see different things!

14:03.801 --> 14:06.054
Gosh! How many times should I tell you?!

14:06.054 --> 14:09.724
Do you think movement is all the
Spirit's Eye can appraise?

14:10.558 --> 14:13.269
That's it! Not only
I can appraise its movements,

14:13.269 --> 14:15.063
but also
its trajectory of attacks.

14:15.063 --> 14:16.882
Appraise! No...

14:17.315 --> 14:18.858
With this Spirit's Eye, I cast...

14:19.275 --> 14:20.902
Super Appraise!

14:22.480 --> 14:23.320
(Gremlin's Attack Trajectory (S+)
Trajectory of the sickle attack to the left leg.)

14:24.364 --> 14:25.740
It has stopped moving?

14:27.158 --> 14:28.326
No, that's not it.

14:28.326 --> 14:33.498
Its movements started to appear in slow motion
once I had super-appraised its trajectory!

14:33.498 --> 14:35.458
I can't believe I've done this.

14:35.458 --> 14:38.211
Then, while in this state I will...

14:43.966 --> 14:46.969
What? Just one hit?

14:46.969 --> 14:51.891
I see. Even if it looks slow to me,
the actual speed is different.

14:51.891 --> 14:55.478
Taking a counterattack at that speed
would pack considerable power.

14:56.145 --> 14:59.273
I defeated a monster for the first time!

14:59.273 --> 15:01.692
And an S-rank one at that!

15:01.692 --> 15:03.236
I did it!

15:03.872 --> 15:07.490
One success is too early to celebrate.

15:07.490 --> 15:11.744
Defeat all the gremlins
around here, for now.

15:11.744 --> 15:12.828
Got it?

15:12.830 --> 15:14.080
Okay!

15:15.540 --> 15:18.167
Is Ein all right?

15:21.441 --> 15:22.630
It's finally over.

15:22.630 --> 15:23.756
How was that, Ursula?

15:24.871 --> 15:26.924
You have the Spirit's Eye, after all.

15:26.926 --> 15:29.262
This much should be the least you can do.

15:30.538 --> 15:33.474
Well, it's about time to move
on to the next training.

15:33.474 --> 15:34.892
What's the next training?

15:34.892 --> 15:38.896
Appraise the gremlin's ability
and make it your own.

15:39.856 --> 15:43.151
Unlike humans who
acquire skills later in life,

15:43.151 --> 15:46.529
monsters are born with abilities.

15:46.529 --> 15:51.242
While I can appraise the skills,
I don't think I can make them my own.

15:51.242 --> 15:53.035
That's exactly why you're a rookie.

15:53.578 --> 15:56.122
Listen up. Appraisal, at its very core,

15:56.122 --> 16:00.334
means gaining and understanding opponents'
information and making it yours.

16:00.334 --> 16:03.045
It does indeed become
part of my knowledge, but...

16:03.045 --> 16:05.256
Now that you have the Spirit's Eye,

16:05.256 --> 16:07.575
that information can be turned
into not only knowledge,

16:07.576 --> 16:10.052
but also your own experience.

16:10.372 --> 16:12.722
The Spirit's Eye is amazing!

16:12.722 --> 16:15.725
Right? Yuri is amazing!

16:15.725 --> 16:16.934
Come on, give it a try.

16:17.600 --> 16:18.930
(Gremlin's Ability (S)
Super Acceleration (S+))

16:26.063 --> 16:27.689
What is this...

16:27.691 --> 16:30.948
It's like the information is being
directly shoved into my brain.

16:31.199 --> 16:34.452
Does this mean I've gained
the gremlin's ability?

16:34.452 --> 16:36.204
Try it on for size.

16:41.876 --> 16:44.045
I'm fast! But...

16:47.965 --> 16:51.219
Yeah, no. My body just can't keep it up.

16:51.219 --> 16:54.222
It feels like every muscle
is tearing apart...

16:54.222 --> 16:57.099
That's only natural.
Just keep running non-stop.

16:57.099 --> 16:57.975
What...

16:57.975 --> 17:02.021
Running takes not only the muscles on
your legs, but all muscles in your body.

17:02.980 --> 17:06.192
Every time the muscle fibers get torn,
they get stronger.

17:07.735 --> 17:10.571
Repeat this process
tens of thousands of times

17:10.571 --> 17:14.492
and you'll develop strong muscles
that can withstand any move.

17:14.492 --> 17:15.660
Come on! Move it!

17:15.660 --> 17:17.745
You're a demon! A devil! Savage!

17:17.745 --> 17:20.248
Dammit!

17:20.873 --> 17:23.850
So I kept on running and running.

17:23.852 --> 17:26.390
As a result, my muscle
fibers stopped tearing

17:26.391 --> 17:29.340
and I gained strong
and flexible muscles.

17:30.466 --> 17:31.801
Say, Ursula.

17:31.801 --> 17:35.304
I feel like I might be able to
defeat Death Bear already.

17:35.304 --> 17:38.057
Don't get too cocky!
You'll barely give him death.

17:38.057 --> 17:40.810
I see. I guess that's true.

17:43.312 --> 17:48.442
It feels terrible offering this,
but I'll let you appraise my ability.

17:49.735 --> 17:51.070
What a face!

17:51.070 --> 17:52.947
Speaking of, which ability are you...

17:53.489 --> 17:54.824
It's hot!

17:55.151 --> 17:56.576
Did you Appraise that?

17:56.576 --> 17:57.827
As if!

17:57.827 --> 18:01.414
Listen carefully, now.
That was Cancel Chant.

18:01.414 --> 18:01.450
In other words, it's an ability to
cast spells just by thinking about it.

18:01.450 --> 18:05.080
(Ursula's Ability (S+)
Cancel Chant (S+))
In other words, it's an ability to
cast spells just by thinking about it.

18:05.084 --> 18:08.377
This eliminates the need
to chant to cast spells,

18:08.378 --> 18:10.089
giving its user an advantage in combat.

18:10.089 --> 18:12.765
If I can cast magic in no time,
I'd be unstoppable!

18:12.767 --> 18:14.093
Looks like you get it.

18:14.093 --> 18:17.847
Then quickly Appraise this
Cancel Chant and Fireball.

18:19.140 --> 18:20.725
A-Appraise!

18:20.760 --> 18:22.720
(Ursula's Ability (S+)
Cancel Chant (S+))

18:32.318 --> 18:34.695
So? Did you manage to Appraise this time?

18:34.697 --> 18:37.199
I get the Cancel Chant, somehow...

18:37.199 --> 18:39.076
We can just redo it, then.

18:39.076 --> 18:40.328
Wait, what?

18:41.454 --> 18:41.490
A-Appraise!

18:41.490 --> 18:42.830
(Ursula's Ability (S+), Fireball (E))
A-Appraise!

18:46.417 --> 18:48.586
It's the fifth day of the training.

18:48.586 --> 18:52.465
Since I wasn't originally a mage,
my mana was below average

18:52.465 --> 18:54.342
and I quickly became exhausted.

18:54.342 --> 18:59.096
When my mana ran out,
Yuri used Yggdrasil Droplets on me.

18:59.096 --> 19:02.850
Not only does it restore mana,

19:02.850 --> 19:04.602
but it also expands mana capacity.

19:05.227 --> 19:08.856
However, consuming it while
you still have mana left...

19:08.856 --> 19:10.608
...won't expand your mana capacity.

19:10.608 --> 19:14.362
So, I had to exhaust my mana
completely before using it.

19:15.613 --> 19:18.616
After about half a month
of this training,

19:18.616 --> 19:22.119
I was able to not only unleash
a thousand fireballs at once...

19:22.119 --> 19:23.663
Windstorm!

19:23.663 --> 19:25.623
...but also intermediate-level spells.

19:26.290 --> 19:29.043
I have abilities I appraised from
gremlins and Ursula,

19:29.043 --> 19:32.380
my relentlessly trained body
and expanded mana capacity,

19:32.380 --> 19:36.008
as well as the Super Appraise
enabled by the Spirit's Eye.

19:36.008 --> 19:36.882
With these...

19:37.181 --> 19:39.345
This should do it, I suppose.

19:39.345 --> 19:40.137
Ursula?

19:40.137 --> 19:41.806
It's about prime time.

19:43.939 --> 19:45.851
How about a revenge match?

19:58.364 --> 20:00.683
No need to be nervous, kid.

20:01.283 --> 20:05.496
While you are still weak,
you're stronger than before.

20:05.496 --> 20:06.789
Well, yes...

20:06.789 --> 20:10.793
It annoys me to admit this,
but you pick things up quite quickly.

20:10.793 --> 20:14.655
I think you'll easily win this
if you make use of your training.

20:14.657 --> 20:16.590
You do hand out praises, eh?

20:16.590 --> 20:19.719
Shut up. Just hurry up
and finish him off, you fool!

20:19.719 --> 20:20.803
Ouch!

20:21.679 --> 20:23.556
That's right. I'm no longer the same.

20:23.873 --> 20:25.724
Unlike the person I was back then!

20:27.309 --> 20:29.311
All right. Let's do this!

20:38.779 --> 20:41.782
Don't flinch, Ein.
Show your strength!

20:42.867 --> 20:44.785
The fight is on, Death Bear!

20:46.036 --> 20:48.038
Fireball!

20:51.667 --> 20:52.752
You're lacking control.

20:52.752 --> 20:53.919
I was in a hurry!

20:53.919 --> 20:56.589
But, I guess it works
as a distraction.

20:57.809 --> 20:59.060
Super Accelerate!

21:01.969 --> 21:03.679
Super Appraise!

21:05.681 --> 21:07.683
Windstorm!

21:15.316 --> 21:19.612
It's true that my single spells
are weak because I'm not a mage.

21:19.612 --> 21:22.573
That's why I have to
land each of them precisely.

21:22.979 --> 21:25.075
If I don't succeed at the first strike,

21:25.459 --> 21:27.578
I'll just barrage him until he collapses!

21:29.830 --> 21:32.958
Take this! 100 consecutive Fireballs!

21:53.437 --> 21:55.564
Huh? What?

21:55.564 --> 21:58.067
Was Death Bear really this weak?

21:59.193 --> 22:00.361
No...

22:01.264 --> 22:03.197
I've become stronger!

22:09.578 --> 22:14.918
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.920 --> 22:19.922
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.922 --> 22:22.341
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.341 --> 22:25.428
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.431 --> 22:30.391
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.393 --> 22:37.148
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.148 --> 22:42.028
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.028 --> 22:47.033
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.033 --> 22:51.829
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.122 --> 22:55.583
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.583 --> 22:57.043
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.043 --> 23:03.925
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.802 --> 23:11.224
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.224 --> 23:15.895
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.895 --> 23:18.564
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.564 --> 23:21.150
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.150 --> 23:26.072
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.072 --> 23:28.491
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.491 --> 23:31.033
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.035 --> 23:31.660
(Even Given)

23:31.660 --> 23:32.244
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.244 --> 23:32.453
(I'm)

23:32.453 --> 23:32.620
(Actually)

23:32.620 --> 23:32.745
(the Strongest)

23:35.799 --> 23:38.317
Next episode: Revenge Match.

23:38.317 --> 23:40.310
(Next episode: Revenge Match)
